{"id":445,"name":"garchomp","speciesId":445,"dex":445,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["dragon","ground"],"stats":{"hp":108,"attack":130,"defense":95,"special-attack":80,"special-defense":85,"speed":102},"abilities":[{"name":"sand-veil","hidden":false},{"name":"rough-skin","hidden":true}],"height":19,"weight":950,"baseExp":270,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/445.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/445.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/445.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/445.ogg","genus":"Mach Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"When it folds up its body and extends its wings, it looks like a jet plane. It flies at sonic speed."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It flies at speeds equal to a jet fighter plane. It never allows its prey to escape."},{"version":"platinum","text":"It is said that when one runs at high speed, its wings create blades of wind that can fell nearby trees."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"Its body is covered in fine scales that reduce drag, enabling it to fly at high speeds."},{"version":"sun","text":"It can fly at speeds rivaling jet planes. It dives into flocks of bird Pokémon and gulps the entire flock down whole."},{"version":"moon","text":"The protuberances on its head serve as sensors. It can even detect distant prey."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It flies at the speed of sound while searching for prey, and it has midair battles with Salamence as the two compete for food."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its fine scales don’t just reduce wind resistance—their sharp edges also cause injury to any opponent who attacks it."},{"version":"sword","text":"Garchomp makes its home in volcanic mountains. It flies through the sky as fast as a jet airplane, hunting 